{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36293","headline":"尚书新创敌楼二首 一 · 方干","name":"尚书新创敌楼二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下马政成无一事，应须胜地过朝昏。\n笙歌引出桃花洞，罗绣拥来金谷园。\n十里水云吞半郭，九秋山月入千门。\n常闻大厦堪栖息，燕雀心知不敢言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}